menu "Bench App"

    config BENCH_APP_SKIP_MARK_VALID
        bool "Skip marking the image valid (rollback test)"
        default n
        help
            Leave the image in PENDING_VERIFY instead of calling
            esp_ota_mark_app_valid_cancel_rollback(). It runs once; the next
            reset makes the bootloader roll it back, which lands the board in
            the CAN updater. Build it in its own build dir with
            sdkconfig.skip_mark_valid (docs/bench-test.md).

    config BENCH_APP_CRASH_LOOP
        bool "Abort after confirming the image (crash-loop recovery test)"
        depends on !BENCH_APP_SKIP_MARK_VALID
        default n
        help
            Marks the image valid, then aborts after two seconds on every boot.
            Build in crash/ with sdkconfig.crash_loop (docs/bench-test.md).

endmenu
